# Operator break-glass tooling. Deliberately unversioned: this repo mirrors to a
# public GitHub remote, and the script encodes maintainer-local infrastructure
# (specific vmid, operator account, sudoers path) — the kind of detail CLAUDE.md
# keeps in CLAUDE.local.md rather than the public tree. Its canonical home is the
# Proxmox host it runs on.
scripts/breakglass.sh

# Claude Code agent skeletons. The CANONICAL set (.claude/agents/powernode/,
# generated from the global seeded agents by `rails claude:sync_agents`) IS
# committed — it is environment-independent (slug-keyed, no per-install ids) and
# freshness-gated by scripts/check-claude-agents-fresh.sh. Only an ACCOUNT's own
# export (ACCOUNT_ID=... — clones and local agents) is per-checkout and ignored.
.claude/agents/powernode-local/

